# Corrigendum and measurement for gen_l25_fcov_exercised.log (committed 8f265b2, 8866 bytes,
# md5 d7ebcb05197e73e149655108a5c96ac3). That log's bytes do not move; this file carries everything added after it.
#
# THE CORRIGENDUM. Lines 11 and 12 of that log state: "The shared form agreed on all nine verdicts and all 78 bins
# and is recorded here as a cross-check, not as the source." When it committed, that claim rested on TWO entries of
# the nine: those were the only two I had compared. The claim preceded its evidence. Section 2 below is the
# measurement over all nine, and the claim holds, but a reader of the committed log should know it was asserted
# first and measured afterwards. The overclaim is mine and is answered as a row in gen_critic_response_flow.md.
#
# Nothing else in that log is corrected. Its verdicts, its 78 hit bins, its owed-bin counts and its
# does-not-establish section stand as committed.
# Taken on the same artifacts: out roots l25_exercise_1430 (shared build) and l25_isolated_1435 (one output
# directory and coverage database per entry), build identity b48479a3bc6f1d9f, source HEAD 813994b.
