== 3. how this measurement nearly reported the opposite, kept because the hazard is general ==
   My first comparison selected the shared-form run directory with a PREFIX GLOB. This entry family is
   prefix-nested: ecc, ecc_data, ecc_data_two, ecc_data_noprobe. Asked for _data the glob matched
   _data_noprobe, and the comparison reported two bins differing:
       cp_alert_pulses.one      isolated 494   'shared' 148
       cp_major_nmi_quiet.yes   isolated 848   'shared' 855
   Those two values are _data_noprobe's own counts, visible in section 4. A third run of _data at the same
   seed in a fresh directory reproduced 494 and 848, which is what identified the fault as the selector's
   rather than the runs'. Reproduce before believing a discrepancy; and any prefix match over this entry
   family can pick a sibling silently, which the per-test isolation check in section 1 is the guard against.

